@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Computer Science Department";
}

<div class="container my-4">

    <div class="card border-0 shadow-lg rounded-4 overflow-hidden">

        <div class="p-4 text-center text-white"
             style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d6efd,#4f8cff);">

            <h1 class="fw-bold">💻 Computer Science Department</h1>

            <p class="mb-0">
                
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card-body p-4">

            <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-3">
                About the Department
            </h3>

            <p>
                Computer Science is the need of today's era. In this century,
                computers have become an important part of our lives just like
                food, clothing and shelter. Computer technology has proved to be
                a boon for the digital age.
            </p>

            <p>
                A computer is a device that accurately follows the instructions
                given to it. These instructions are used to perform various
                tasks through computers. The Computer Science Department of the
                college has also conducted innovative activities in the social
                field by using computer technology.
            </p>


            <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mt-4">
                Academic Achievements
            </h3>

            <p>
                The result of the Sixth Semester Degree Examination for the
                academic year 2023–2024 was <strong>100%</strong>.
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Sakshi Sunil Narwankar</strong> secured First Rank
                    in the college with <strong>9.35 CGPA</strong>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>Kalpesh Dattaram Jadhav</strong> secured Second Rank
                    with <strong>9.34 CGPA</strong>.
                </li>

                <li>
                    <strong>Shreyash Sunil Pawar</strong> secured Third Rank
                    with <strong>9.28 CGPA</strong>.
                </li>
            </ul>


            <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mt-4">
                Achievements in Extracurricular Activities
            </h3>

            <p>
                Students of the department have also achieved success in
                extracurricular activities.
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Kalpesh Dattaram Jadhav</strong> secured Second Rank
                    in the National Level Online Science Competition conducted
                    by GMRT.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Kalpesh Dattaram Jadhav, a Third Year Computer Science
                    student, secured Second Rank in the Debate Competition
                    (Group A – Marathi) at the 56th University Youth Festival
                    organized under the University of Mumbai.
                </li>

                <li>
                    He also secured Third Rank in the Elocution Competition
                    (Group A – Marathi).
                </li>

                <li>
                    Students of the department participated in various
                    competitions organized by the college and performed
                    successfully.
                </li>
            </ul>


            <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mt-4">
                Computer Exhibition
            </h3>

            <p>
                A Computer Exhibition was organized in the college under the
                Computer Science Department. Students developed new
                applications, games and websites as part of the exhibition.
            </p>


            <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mt-4">
                Expert Guidance and Seminars
            </h3>

            <p>
                Along with the academic development of students, the Computer
                Science Department organized expert guidance sessions for
                their overall development.
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Expert Guidance Sessions</li>
                <li>Corporate Interview Discussion Sessions</li>
                <li>Game Processing Expert Session</li>
                <li>Linux Expert Session</li>
            </ul>


            <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mt-4">
                Socially Useful Projects
            </h3>

            <p>
                Students of Dnyandeep College regularly use their technical
                knowledge to develop various socially useful projects.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-4">
        <a asp-controller="Home"
           asp-action="Index"
           class="btn btn-secondary px-4">
            ← Back to Home
        </a>
